{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-06963676-c3c3-429d-bc6b-9c71c310cf6e-1\nfc_dbc55253-4b75-9716-8032-bcb931a1b81d_1","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/Users/user/work/delegate-15-backend-split/docs/agents/domain.md"},"result":{"success":{"content":"# Domain docs\n\nThis repo is single-context: one `CONTEXT.md` (the glossary) and `docs/adr/` (decisions), both at the root. Both are created lazily by `/domain-modeling` once a term or decision is settled; until then they are absent, and that is expected.\n\nBefore exploring an area, read `CONTEXT.md` and the ADRs that touch it, when they exist.\n\n- **Glossary terms**: name domain concepts (in issue titles, proposals, hypotheses, test names) with the term `CONTEXT.md` defines. A concept the glossary lacks is either invented language to reconsider or a gap to note for `/domain-modeling`.\n- **ADR conflicts**: when your output contradicts an ADR, say so explicitly, in the form _Contradicts ADR-NNNN (<title>), but worth reopening because…_\n","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":9,"fileSize":744,"path":"/Users/user/work/delegate-15-backend-split/docs/agents/domain.md","readRange":{"startLine":1,"endLine":9},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-06963676-c3c3-429d-bc6b-9c71c310cf6e-1\nfc_dbc55253-4b75-9716-8032-bcb931a1b81d_1","startedAtMs":"1790853424939","completedAtMs":"1790853425308"},"model_call_id":"a39a3dae-67ec-4300-bf85-501258a620a7-0-l0d6","session_id":"1d546125-183e-46a3-aaab-e9734f91ce3e","timestamp_ms":1790853425217}
