d to read plugin version: {e}\")),\n    }\n\n    let mut report = DoctorReport {\n        ok: false,\n        plugin: DoctorPluginInfo {\n            version: plugin_version,\n        },\n        agent: DoctorAgentInfo {\n            found: false,\n            path: None,\n            version: None,\n            error: None,\n        },\n        account: DoctorAccountInfo {\n            logged_in: false,\n            email: None,\n            subscription: None,\n            current_model: None,\n            error: None,\n        },\n        model_menu: DoctorModelMenuInfo {\n            configured_ids: vec![],\n            account_ids: None,\n            missing_from_account: vec![],\n            prices_checkable: false,\n            note: String::new(),\n            error: None,\n        },\n        warnings,\n        failures,\n    };\n\n    // Cursor is the only implemented backend. `from_name` None is a skip in the CLI.\n    if let Some(backend) = crate::backends::Backend::from_name(\"cursor\") {\n        backend.fill_doctor(&mut report, &opts);\n    }\n    report.ok = report.failures.is_empty();\n    report\n}\n","message":"The file /Users/user/work/delegate-15-backend-split/src/doctor.rs has been updated."}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-7bdde0df-7e9c-4a12-82c0-7993a2d59feb-114\nfc_e4807b5d-dda4-9e95-8614-9addc239f630_1","startedAtMs":"1790854757411","completedAtMs":"1790854758680"},"model_call_id":"a39a3dae-67ec-4300-bf85-501258a620a7-37-2wcw","session_id":"1d546125-183e-46a3-aaab-e9734f91ce3e","timestamp_ms":1790854758630}
